WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.770
One carne. That will be 160 buildcash please.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.940
Thank you very much!

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.990
Here you go.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.410
It's the bread that I promised you.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.210
So it's true that you live here.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.290
I thought you were kidding me.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.340
What about school?

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.050
That necktie looks like part of the
Komoku Academy uniform.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:36.180
School...

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.640
Don't tell me you don't even know
where your own school is?

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:44.940
So you really don't remember a thing.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.440
What about this city?

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:57.740
In Neo Kyoto, the politics, economy, and
your fate are all determined by Build-Divide.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:03.250
If you're good at Build-Divide, you can enjoy
an affluent life in the center of the city.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:08.920
But if you're an inferior player, you're forced
to suffer hardship in the outer district.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:13.670
This society is shaped by "hyperdemocracy."

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.890
Using Build-Divide's meritocracy-based
order as its social infrastructure,

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:23.810
one person has unified the will of the people,
and determined the direction this society will take.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:28.600
That person is the King,
the one we're trying to reach.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:34.440
To defeat the King in Build-Divide,
and have your wish granted...

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:39.200
We call that battle Rebuild.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:13.460
#02 Lonely Baby Bird

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.380
SANJOBASHI SHOPPING DISTRICT

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.840
There don't seem to be
any challengers around here.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.640
How can you tell?

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.010
What do you mean?

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.100
Blink twice in a row
like you did during our battle.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:37.360
You see, right?
That's how you can see everyone's stats.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:41.360
By looking at that data, you can also
find out if that person is a challenger.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:46.240
Everyone living in Neo Kyoto
wears these scout lenses.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:51.120
KOMOKU ACADEMY

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.910
Well, remember anything?

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.120
I've never been here before.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:57.090
Oh, whatever. Let's just head to the
faculty room and see if you're regist—

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.750
Wait, is that you, Teruto?

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.260
It is you!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.970
You never showed up after I got the transfer notice,
so you had me really worried.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.390
So you brought him here, Ms. Banka?

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.100
Yes.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:11.310
Thank goodness!
Teruto can't afford to miss any more days.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:15.310
Oh no you don't!
I'm not letting you out of my sight.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.900
So he does go here.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.150
I guess I can trust him, then.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:23.570
First, we're going to need info on any challengers.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.160
Look, I got myself a new deck case.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.450
Oh? That looks nice.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.950
Where'd you buy it?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.500
Let's see.
I want you to check it out too, Hiyo-Hiyo.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:39.210
In other words, Build-Divide, which was
introduced in Japan in the 17th century,

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.590
has long been used for gambling purposes.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:51.310
In the 1950s, the former entertainment behemoth
Billmon conducted an academic study...

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.990
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.880
Looks like there are some right here at school.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.290
Did you hear me?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.880
I'm the one who’s going to win.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.340
I like your confidence.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.840
All right, let's go look for one.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.470
I thought we might find one here...

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.680
...but I guess it's not that easy.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.520
Teruto, why do you want to take down the King?

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:42.570
Many people oppose the Exclusionism
principles the King's been touting.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.070
Are you one of them?

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.530
I have no interest in this city or any doctrines.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.660
All I want to do is defeat the King, that's all.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.120
I'll be happy...

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.990
...to pluck that wish right out of your hands.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:05:59.920
Who are you?

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:03.340
Middle school second year, Hiyori Munenashi.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.840
A fair fight is all I'm looking for!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.590
This girl is a challenger.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:14.560
Mr. Kurabe, you're a challenger yourself, right?
I know all about it.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:18.140
When I saw you this morning,
I took the liberty of scouting you.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:22.400
That look in your eyes.
You're going to accept my challenge, aren't you?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.860
I'm taking your key chip.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.860
Request Rebuild!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.240
Confirming Rebuild Request.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.450
Please bet your key chips.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.250
One bet.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:41.830
I'm betting...

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:43.590
...three.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:44.920
I'm all in.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.300
Hey, what are you smoking?

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.760
One against three, that's not a bet.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.850
If you lose, you'll lose your right to challenge.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.060
It's more fun this way.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:56.430
Oh, come on!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.940
Rebuild established.
Now erecting a defensive barrier.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.360
I'm not holding back, I'm going all out.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.940
Call. Douglark!

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.080
Call. Bloom.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.170
Really, I hope you know what you're doing.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.420
I get the first move. Here I come, Teruto.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:27.590
- Build-Divide.
- Build-Divide.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:32.180
Energy Set. Johanna, Spend Grenader. Accept.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.930
I'm going for a direct attack on your life.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.560
Starting with a Burst Trigger?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:46.320
Having regrets about betting all of your chips?

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.690
Are you done?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.780
Defiant, aren't you? End of turn.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:52.860
My turn. Draw.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.780
Energy Set. Accept.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.290
Nadiya, Brahmadatta. Attack.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.160
End of turn.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:05.710
It's payback time.
Arubel, Angel of Sword. Accept.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.880
With Arubel's appearance,
Johanna's power goes up by three thousand.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.050
Using Johanna to attack Nadiya.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.890
Next, using Arubel to attack your life.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.600
End of turn.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.480
So she ended her turn keeping two Energy.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:22.980
My turn.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:28.730
As long as you still have Energy, there's a card that
can take action even during your opponent's turn.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.360
Watch your back, Teruto.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.450
Viena, Battle Engineer. Accept.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.410
Using her powers to draw one card,
while discarding another.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.620
Accepting an additional Viena.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.790
Drawing one card, discarding another.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.370
Using both Vienas to attack Johanna and Arubel.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:44.960
Oh!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.210
It could be a trap.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.510
What? It passed?

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:55.300
Oh, Johanna! Arubel!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.590
End of turn.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:59.220
Not bad at all, Senpai.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.680
But that's as far as you'll go.
I'm going to start playing for keeps now.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:06.600
Holy sword that cuts through fate. Accept.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.690
Douglark, Angel of Subjugation!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.870
Territory. Build Arise!

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.630
Sky Fortress!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.350
So this is that girl's Territory.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:44.230
Activating Territory ability,
drawing the top two cards from my deck.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:48.690
If I draw a Buster Card unit,
I'm putting it on the field...

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:49.440
Huh?

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:53.320
That was my chance to send one unit to the field.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.780
You got lucky there huh, Senpai?

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:59.160
Douglark refrains from attacking. End of turn.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.580
You'd think she would've sent it to fight.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.620
Is she worried about a counterattack?

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:07.500
Maybe since you can keep your units
standing without attacking,

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.870
CAN BLOCK — CAN'T BLOCK

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.710
she can make a move to block him?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.210
All right, now I can block you.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.590
Oh, I see.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.050
Spilling the beans herself.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:16.840
My turn.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.050
Once again, Nadiya. Accept.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.930
Now the command. Hard Luck Craps.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.010
Target Douglark.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.900
Reducing Douglark's power by three thousand.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.820
No way. Douglark!

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.820
Using Nadiya to attack the player!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:39.320
Ouch! Whoa!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.620
Wait, is this girl...

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.740
...inferior?

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.960
I can't go on like this. I've got to attack.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.550
Activating the Sky Fortress ability.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:57.800
All right!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.380
Buster Card.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.720
Sending Mahulena, Pyromaniac to the field.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:05.220
Inflicting three thousand damage on
Nadiya with Mahulena's Appearance Effect.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.980
Scuir, Bubble Spirit. Accept.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.350
Using Mahulena to attack your life.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:13.980
Next, sending Scuir to attack.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.110
Yay! Another Burst.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:23.370
Huh?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.200
Gotcha. Shot Trigger.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.210
Shot Trigger, playing that card at no Cost.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.460
Command, Capital Breaker.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.920
Target Mahulena.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.000
Run, Mahulena!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:34.920
It's no use.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.300
Mahulena...

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:43.930
End of turn.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:45.390
Draw.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:54.520
The only thing that awaits
you up ahead is darkness.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.400
What?

00:11:55.900 --> 00:12:00.610
Sending all living beings into chaos.
Repeating death and rebirth.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.570
Accept.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.660
Bloom, Soul Wager!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.750
Territory. Build Arise.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.420
Casino of Fate.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.470
Activating Territory ability.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:23.720
Sending two cards from my deck to the Cemetery,

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:26.260
and betting my fate on
the existence of a Buster Card.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.270
No Buster Card.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.690
Using Casino of Fate's effect to destroy Scuir.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.770
Scuir!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.650
I've won this wager.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.150
Resting Bloom and activating her ability.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.780
Removing the six cards in
the Cemetery to infinite darkness.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.700
Sending Frida from the Cemetery to the field,

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.410
and activating her ability, Scout Three.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:52.160
Switching the order of the top three
cards in my deck at will.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.790
Using Frida to launch a
Two-Hit Attack on the player.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.630
No Trigger. One more card.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:00.750
No way!

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:04.880
This one too?

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.470
Yay! It's a Shot Trigger.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.470
Shackle of Ethics.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:14.890
If I use this, I can return
one unit to the top of my deck.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.100
But which one should I return?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.440
Frida's Two-Hit is scary.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:23.030
But if I just return a unit,
she could show up again during my next turn.

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.320
I should...

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:28.450
Command. Shackle of Ethics. Target Bloom.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.120
End of turn.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.870
My turn.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.540
I've got to take down Frida during this turn.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.790
Activating Territory ability.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.300
Buster Card.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.220
Sending Nadiya to the field too.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.380
Using Nadiya's ability to draw one more card.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.350
This is where it starts.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.180
Mahulena, Accept.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:54.390
Inflicting three thousand damage on
Frida with Mahulena's appearance.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:58.020
Please Mahulena. Defeat Frida!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.860
Thank you Mahulena.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.110
Next, using Nadiya to attack your life.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.120
End of turn.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:14.200
I'm not giving up, all right?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:18.870
Instead of using Nadiya to block an attack,
she attacked his life. Bold play.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.380
Still.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:25.510
You have no clue about the true nature of darkness.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.470
Do you really think you can get
through this if you try harder?

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.220
My turn. Draw.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.100
Bloom.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.020
Bloom. Accept.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.440
That's right. That Ace...

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.070
Activating her ability.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.240
The one who exploits the dead...

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.820
Sacrifice yourself again to the battlefield, Frida.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.780
So this is the true nature of darkness.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:58.750
As long as Bloom exists, the darkness
and the Cemetery will always be linked.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.080
Trample her, Frida.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.500
Unleash a Two-Hit Attack on her life.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.090
Here's the second hit!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:12.890
End of turn.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.220
Just one left.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.930
At this rate I'll...

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.520
No...

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:28.610
I don't want to lose!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.790
My turn. Activating Territory ability.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.040
Buster Cards costing less than five.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.590
Sending Godonis, Angel of War to the field.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.960
Also activating his abilities.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.220
Also checking the top card in my deck.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.550
If it's a unit costing less than four,
I'm sending it to the field.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.180
Mahulena, Accept.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.140
With her appearance,
Frida takes three thousand damage.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.430
Sorry about before. Leaving you all alone.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:03.560
One more time please. Douglark!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:11.530
For every fellow unit, Douglark
receives a power-up of three thousand.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.070
I have three units in the field.

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:16.620
Plus nine thousand,
that's twelve thousand power.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.580
No! That's higher than Bloom's power stats.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.290
Using Douglark to attack Bloom.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.170
Activating Douglark's Attack Effect.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.800
Resting Nadiya, and keeping Douglark standing.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.760
Using Godonis to attack Frida.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.140
I'm not going to lose.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.560
If I lose, I'll have to go back there.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.940
If I lose, I'll be all alone again.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:48.070
I'm going to win, no matter what!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.120
The darkness. I've severed it.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.790
Douglark can still be stacked.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.000
Teruto's down to one life.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.080
If there's a Burst, he'll lose. But...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.790
It might not show up.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.000
Will it appear?

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.210
Or not?

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.340
Will I win?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.180
Or lose?

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.850
Calm down Hiyori. His field is empty.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:25.060
I've got Mahulena standing by as a decoy.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:29.020
As long as she has a decoy,
Teruto will have to attack it first.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:32.030
I'm leaving Douglark here as a blocker too.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.490
End of turn.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.950
I see. That's too bad.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:37.910
What?

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.330
If you can't put your soul on the line,
you can't win.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.500
My turn. Activating Territory ability!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.500
It's that Scout Three!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.710
Teruto knows how this is going to end.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.170
No Buster Cards.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.550
Annihilate Mahulena.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.970
Now that there are less units,
Douglark's power stats will also go down.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.970
Now. Riverwort, DeadRook. Accept.

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:18.320
Activating abilities.
Slashing all enemy powers by six thousand.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:27.500
Now I'm finishing you off. Riverwort,
unleash a Two-Hit Attack on the player.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:44.390
Winner, Teruto Kurabe.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:55.780
That final turn. If Douglark had gone after him,
Teruto would've lost once a Burst was drawn.

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:59.450
This time around, Teruto's determination won out.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.780
Is that what happened here?

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.530
Good job.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.740
At least, that's what I'd normally say.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.040
But why did you bet all of your key chips?

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.870
If you'd lost, it would've been all over for you.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.500
My only path is going forward.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.500
What's that supposed to mean?

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:22.090
I lost!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:29.520
Hiyori, was it? You fought a great battle.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.810
It doesn't mean a thing if I lose.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.520
Why are you taking it so hard?

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.690
Because it's my dream.

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:47.950
Ever since I can remember,
I've lived in the outer district.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.590
I was always all alone.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.210
What about your parents?

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:01.430
I don't know. I think they must have died.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:03.890
I have no one to rely on.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.930
So maybe I'm just going to die here.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.350
That's what I always thought.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:10.940
But...

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:23.530
Since then, I've practiced
playing Build-Divide everyday.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.240
I started playing well enough to win battles.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.910
Finally, I was able to leave the outer district.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:33.790
Your dreams can come true
in Neo Kyoto through Build-Divide.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:41.380
So I want to take down the King and go to
that world filled with light just across the river.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.720
That's my dream.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.640
That dream will never come true.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.680
Come on, Teruto.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.480
Not a chance with the way you are now.

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:58.730
I've made up my mind.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.820
Please let me be your apprentice!

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:06.160
She's not talking to me, you know.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:10.040
I fought a pretty good battle, didn’t I?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.950
Don't you think that's amazing?

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:15.580
My own potential is starting to scare me.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:20.590
So that I can polish these skills of mine,
please make me your apprentice.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.050
Didn't see that coming.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:23.220
So...

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.090
Though I am incompetent, please train me well.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.220
What are you going to do, Teruto?

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.220
Going home.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:37.520
Please wait! Your number one apprentice Hiyori,
will follow you to the ends of the earth.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.440
Shut it. You can go on being a lonely baby bird.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:46.410
Chick? How cute!
I don't mind being a baby bird.

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:48.910
Starting today, my name is Baby Bird.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.620
I'm looking forward to working with you.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.830
Master!

00:21:57.000 --> 00:22:00.000
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:33.930
We defeated a lot of bad guys and got a ton of chips!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.640
I won't let anyone stand in my way.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:40.020
#03 Fiery Feelings

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.600
What wish do you want granted by becoming the King?
